      "title": "BGP: add support of RFC9072",
      "message": "BGP: add support of RFC9072\n\nRFC9072 adapts BGP OPEN message behavior to allows more than 255 bytes of optionals parameters.\nThis commit implements the related mechanism in BGP dissector. Closes #19347\n",
      "author_name": "Yann Lejeune",
      "author_email": "yann.lejeune@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2023-09-16T22:13:20.000+02:00",
